## License Philosophy

This framework uses a **dual license structure** to balance two important goals:

1. **Community improvement** - Framework code improvements are shared with everyone (GPL-3.0)
2. **Commercial viability** - Products built with the framework can be proprietary

**Credit**: The viral/copyleft requirement for framework modifications was suggested by **Arto Jalkanen**, ensuring that all improvements to the framework benefit the community.

---

## Part A: Framework Source Code (GPL-3.0)

**Applies to**: All code in the `.agentic/` directory

### License

THE FRAMEWORK CODE ITSELF is licensed under **GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)**.

Full license text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

### What This Means

If you **modify the framework code** (anything in `.agentic/`):
- ✅ You MUST distribute your modifications under GPL-3.0
- ✅ You MUST make the modified source code available
- ✅ Modifications must preserve this license
- ✅ **Recommended**: Submit pull request to https://github.com/tomgun/agentic-framework

**Why**: This ensures the community benefits from all improvements to the framework itself.

### What is "Framework Code"?

Framework code = Everything in `.agentic/` directory:
- `.agentic/tools/` - Helper scripts
- `.agentic/workflows/` - Workflow documentation
- `.agentic/agents/` - Agent guidelines
- `.agentic/quality/` - Quality standards
- `.agentic/init/` - Initialization scripts
- All other files in `.agentic/`

**If you modify these files, GPL-3.0 applies.**

---

## Part B: Products Built With Framework (Proprietary)

**Applies to**: Your application/product code that USES the framework

### Key Principle

**Your product code is NOT "derivative work" of the framework** - you are using the framework as a tool.

Your product code (outside `.agentic/`) can be under ANY license you choose.

### Three Options for Products

### 1. Free Tier (with Attribution) ⭐

**You MAY:**
- ✅ Use this framework in personal, open source, or commercial projects
- ✅ Keep your product code proprietary (or open source - your choice)
- ✅ Modify your own code however you want
- ✅ Distribute your product commercially

**You MUST:**
- ✅ **Include visible attribution** in your product:
  - **Desktop/Mobile Apps**: In "About" or "Credits" section
  - **Web Applications**: In footer, settings page, or credits page
  - **CLI Tools**: In `--version` or `--about` output
  - **Games**: In credits screen
  - **Example text**: 
    ```
    "Built with Agentic AI Framework"
    https://github.com/tomgun/agentic-framework
    ```
- ✅ Keep this LICENSE file when redistributing the framework itself
- ✅ Do not remove or modify copyright notices in framework files

**You MAY NOT:**
- ❌ Remove or hide the required attribution
- ❌ Claim you created the framework
- ❌ Use the name "Agentic AI Framework" or "Agentic AF" for competing products

### 2. Commercial License (White-Label, No Attribution)

**For:**
- Companies that want to remove attribution from their product
- White-label products
- Products where attribution is not desired

**Cost:**
- **€499 per product** (one-time payment)
  - OR **€99/year per product** (subscription)

**Includes:**
- ✅ Remove all attribution requirements from your product
- ✅ White-label rights
- ✅ Priority email support
- ✅ Commercial use guarantee

**To Purchase:**
- Email: tomas@kipina.fi
- Website: https://github.com/tomgun/agentic-framework

### 3. Kipinä Software Oy & Employees License

**Special Exception:**

**Kipinä Software Oy** and its **current and former employees** may use this framework **without attribution requirements** in:
- ✅ Any personal projects
- ✅ Any open source projects
- ✅ Any commercial projects
- ✅ Client projects (freelance or through other companies)

**This is a perpetual, royalty-free, unrestricted license** for Kipinä Software Oy employees.

No attribution required. Use freely.

