## Distribution & Forking

### Redistributing the Framework:

If you distribute the **framework itself**:
- ✅ Keep all copyright notices intact
- ✅ Include this LICENSE file
- ✅ Include GPL-3.0 license text
- ✅ Do not misrepresent origin or authorship

### Forking:

**If you fork to contribute**:
- ✅ Fork on GitHub
- ✅ Make improvements
- ✅ Submit pull request
- ✅ Your contributions: GPL-3.0

**If you fork to create competing framework**:
- ⚠️ Allowed under GPL-3.0
- ✅ Your fork must also be GPL-3.0
- ✅ Must credit original (Agentic AI Framework)
- ❌ Cannot use same name "Agentic AI Framework" or "Agentic AF"

---

## Enforcement & Compliance

### Framework Modifications:

If you modify framework code and distribute it:
- We may request source code of your modifications (GPL requirement)
- Failure to provide = GPL violation
- Submit pull request to avoid compliance issues

### Product Attribution:

For products using free tier:
- We may request proof of attribution (screenshot, URL)
- Failure to include attribution = license violation
- Options: Add attribution OR purchase commercial license

